      "caveats": "The analysis is limited by the brief abstract, which does not disclose the specific methodology, sample size, or geographic datasets used to measure this cultural influence.",
      "what": "This study evaluates the European Union's international cultural relations strategy a decade after the launch of its 2016 Joint Communication. It analyzes how the EU's cultural diplomacy framework has been implemented globally and assesses its effectiveness in projecting cultural power.",
      "why": "It provides an empirical assessment of a major multilateral cultural policy framework, showing how strategic policy intentions translate into actual diplomatic practice and global influence."
